<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Finagrain Geneve barley tender.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Finagrain Geneve barley tender.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Tuesday accepted the tender of Finagrain Geneve for the supply of 25,000 tonnes of barley at $155.95 per tonne, it said.</p>
<p>The price includes cost and freight, an announcement from the commission said. Shipment of the barley is scheduled in May or June.</p>
</text>
